senses.gloss:
निरु_च्छास (सः-सा-सं)
a. Breathless;
confined, not to be breathed in.

नि-रूपण (णं) 1.
n. Sight; search;
doubt; ascertaining; appointing.

निरोध (धः) 1.
m. Loss; confinement;
check; dislike; preserving.

नि-र्णय (यः) 1.
m. Certainty; doubt;
decision; demonstration.

नि-र्णायन (नं) 1.
n. Giving certainty;
outer angle of an elephant's eye.

नि-र्दिग्ध (ग्धः-ग्धा-ग्धं)
p. Smeared;
anointed; stout, lusty.

नि-र्देश (शः) 1.
m. Order, command;
description; certainty; vicinity.

नि-र्ब्बन्ध (न्धः) 1.
m. Intentness upon;
importunity; seizure; whim.

नि-र्य्यातन (नं) 1.
m. Revenge; gift;
payment; replacing; killing.

नि-र्य्यातित (तः-ता-तं)
p. Taken away;
requited, retaliated.

नि-र्व्वाद (दः) 1.
m. Censure; rumour;
affirmation; absence of dispute.

नि-र्व्वाप (पः) 1.
m. Extinguishing;
gifts in honor of the deceased.

नि-र्व्वापित (तः-ता-तं)
a. Quenched;
cooled; killed; offered up.

नि-र्व्यथन (नं) 1.
n. A hole, a chasm;
pain; freedom from it.

नि-र्हारिन् (री-रिणी-रि)
a. Taking out;
diffusively fragrant; wealthy.
